# Everything under rail3D/data/ is regenerated output, never hand-edited:
# verification_report.json is rewritten by every test run, and data/figures/*.png
# by setup_diagram.py / validation_3d.py. Tracking them made every `git pull`
# fail with "local changes would be overwritten" after running the suite.
# Regenerate with:  python setup_diagram.py  and the validation scripts.
rail3D/data/generated/verification_report.json
rail3D/data/figures/
